<title>USA: U.S. stocks open mostly higher.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks open mostly higher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks opened little changed on Tuesday, with the Dow industrials and broad market indices steady to slightly higher.</p>
<p>The Dow industrials were up one to 6549 and the NASDAQ Index up one to 1282.</p>
